<title>USA: Strouds says CFO Spatz resigns.</title>
<headline>Strouds says CFO Spatz resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc said Jonathan Spatz has resigned as senior vice president and chief financial officer effective June 13, 1997, to accept a position with another company.</p>
<p>Spatz will remain as a director of Strouds.</p>
<p>Douglas Felderman, vice president finance, will assume Spatz's duties as chief financial officer of Strouds.</p>
